      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame the conversation by highlighting the proactive approach to security, emphasizing that continuous monitoring is essential for sustained security excellence and staying ahead of emerging threats. Explain how the upgrade will enable them to respond quickly to potential issues, reducing the risk of security breaches and minimizing downtime. You can also mention the value of real-time insights and user behavior monitoring to help them identify and mitigate potential vulnerabilities. Focus on the benefits of proactive risk management and the evolving threat landscape to emphasize the necessity of the upgrade.",
